{"kind": "mod", "id": 2568, "name": "Disable Headshot Protect", "slug": "disable-headshot-protect", "teaser": "Want to die from getting shot in the head? Time to fix another jank BSG design decision", "owner_name": "ArchangelWTF", "downloads": 1274, "favourites": 2, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": "wtf.archangel.disableheadshotprotect", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Bots", "category_id": 5, "updated_at": "2026-08-02T06:02:13.000000Z", "created_at": "2026-01-30T01:48:47.000000Z", "published_at": "2026-01-30T01:48:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.1", "latest_version": "1.1.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<p>This client modification reverts BSG’s decision to allow certain bots on certain ranges to essentially not shoot you in the head by simply ignoring the damage received on your player, all of the times you saw blood splatters and took no damage is likely due to this.</p>\n<p><strong>Not compatible with SAIN, as I have already added this fix to SAIN in 4.4.0</strong></p>\n<h1>Installation:</h1>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/afNPjAw.gif\" alt=\"\" /></p>\n<p>Thanks to Ozen for finding this when I complained about it in the SAIN thread! Without him this fix would not have been possible</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0 <4.1.0", "content_length": 4021, "downloads": 839, "published_at": "2026-01-29T23:00:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2568/disable-headshot-protect/1.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "compatible", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.1.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.1", "content_length": 4329, "downloads": 435, "published_at": "2026-08-02T02:00:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "http